{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/i2gZZwALYl33Cl2IIMa6Eg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:49.576128+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/i2gZZwALYl33Cl2IIMa6Eg","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaiaahuhxkiak2aNa32eKHU9D90b1JNQeEfjxQib4sicJcm2TEMwNlribickZib5xy1EdkbicMY5MiaVPrBibYPK0ias9Opgeg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaiaahuhxkiak2aNa32eKHU9D90b1JNQeEficBBr05Meyl3vE8iay01HkZkG2Y02nSu7C4Ziac3ltTqG8Sbsy7jbhPWw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>华东理工大学卓越工程师学院</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2025年全国大学生暑期夏令营通知</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaiaahuhxkiak2aNa32eKHU9D90b1JNQeEfS5NrxAt6UiaG0EFb5q0wb5MAnmb7E8FEaCsvjkAVIdsibtpQ9IgJEsbQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>前言</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaiaahuhxkiak2aNa32eKHU9D90b1JNQeEficBBr05Meyl3vE8iay01HkZkG2Y02nSu7C4Ziac3ltTqG8Sbsy7jbhPWw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>华东理工大学卓越工程师学院成立于2023年6月18日。学院围绕国家关键急需领域，上海市三大先导产业，学校“两新两大”发展布局，聚焦集成电路、生物医药、人工智能、先进材料、绿色能源、高端装备、关键软件七个领域，打破学科制、院系制壁垒，依托各校企联培专项，以化工优势学科集群和行业龙头企业为支撑 ，以卓越工程师学院为平台，产教融合、学科交叉、协同育人，培养产业“高精尖缺”人才。</span></p><p><span>卓越工程师学院将于</span><strong><span><span>2025年7月7日-8日</span></span></strong><span>举办夏令营活动，为一批热爱科研、基础扎实、素质全面、德才兼备的学生搭建平台，激发学生从事科学研究的兴趣、增进学生对我院的了解。我院举办夏令营的专业包括6个专业型学位点，</span><span><strong><span>0854电子信息</span></strong></span><span>、</span><strong><span><span>0855机械</span></span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span><span>0856材料与化工</span></span></strong><span>、</span><span><strong><span>0857资源与环境</span></strong></span><span>、</span><strong><span><span>0858能源动力</span></span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span><span>0860生物与医药</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>夏令营期间将举办丰富的学术活动、合作企业参观，热忱欢迎来自全国各地的优秀大三本科生参加。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaiaahuhxkiak2aNa32eKHU9D90b1JNQeEfE07iaLXOVY0rLfvAr05XuLzpzjA8HkOre7Lt3JFGKPTe74Licic2yCiccQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请资格</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.政治思想品德合格、身体健康；</span></p><p><span>2.学习成绩优异，本科前五学期学习成绩在其所在专业名列前茅，已获得或将获得所在大学免试推荐研究生资格者优先考虑；</span></p><p><span>3.具有一定学科背景，有志于从事科学技术工作，有较强的科研能力和创新能力；</span></p><p><span>4.英语水平良好，具有较强的英语听说和写作能力。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>2</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请方式</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>本次夏令营实行“申请-审核”制。</span><span><span>申请者即日起至7月4日12点前扫码/网上</span></span><span><span>报名。</span></span></p><p><span>网站链接：（https://f.wps.cn/g/XUqJMnjl）</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaiaahuhxkiak2aNa32eKHU9D90b1JNQeEfSXbq6IylCQN8EzIChHOLVRib3KMgERZcw1va0bVEWdhBfTcflMbHG2g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>2025年7月4日左右将以邮件方式通知入围夏令营学生，请同学们密切关注邮箱。未接到入营通知的同学不再另行通知。</span></p><p><span>建议同学们提前联系我院导师，学院导师联系方式及简介见学院网站：</span></p><p><span>https://iee.ecust.edu.cn/15504/list.htm</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>3</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>参加夏令营学生上传如下材料：</span></p><p><span>1.所在院系盖章的“夏令营申请表”（</span><span><strong><span>请点击“阅读原文”下载原件</span></strong></span><span>）扫描件1份；</span></p><p><span>2.学校教务处或所在院系盖章的成绩单扫描件（本科两年半成绩）1份；</span></p><p><span>3.个人简历1份（不超过一页）。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>4</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报到时携带材料</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.“夏令营活动申请表”纸质版所在院系盖章；</span></p><p><span>2.身份证原件。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>5</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动内容</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>本次夏令营分为线上环节、线下环节，安排内容包括：</span></p><p><span>1.开幕式（线上+线下）</span></p><p><span>2.学校及学院介绍（线上+线下）</span></p><p><span>3.专家讲座（线上+线下）</span></p><p><span>4.合作企业实地参观（线下）</span></p><p><span>5.互动交流（线下）</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>6</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>本次夏令营线下环节遴选50人，往返交通自理。7-8日线下活动期间提供车辆、餐食、住宿。我院将为入选营员统一购买在华东理工大学活动期间的团体意外保险，建议各位营员自行购买旅途意外保险。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>7</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>联系咨询</span></b></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>卓越工程师学院：张老师</span></p><p><span>电话：021-64221080</span></p><p><span>E-mail：</span><span><span>nzhang@ecust.edu.cn</span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>文字| </span></span></strong></span><span>卓越工程师学院</span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>编辑| </span></span></strong></span><span>李政</span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"74358993cfe1ee1d7dec16c6e266591d9a65e5466a348284eae4563ff1f25532","textLength":1169,"sourceSha256":"99e303483e8eee7f7a420e831fd5996b6cace118415dfe80538598933cc150fd","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-87f4ebdd1a7523a2f829","title":"2025年华东理工大学卓越工程师学院2025年全国大学生暑期夏令营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:49.576128+00:00"}
